#. (itstool) path: sect1/title
#: C/index.docbook:132
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:133
msgid ""
"The <application>Panel Trash</application> applet lets you manage your Trash"
" from the panel."
msgstr ""
"L'ajuston <application>escobilhièr</application> vos permet de gerir vòstre "
"escobilhièr dempuèi lo panèl."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:136
msgid ""
"The trash on your panel acts identically to the trash on your desktop, "
"however it is useful because your panels are always visible."
msgstr ""
"L’escobilhièr de vòstre panèl fonciona exactament coma l’escobilhièr de "
"vòstre burèu, mas es util perque vòstres panèls son totjorn visibles."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:141
msgid "Adding Panel Trash to a Panel"
msgstr "Apondre Escobilhièr al tablèu de bòrd"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:142
msgid ""
"To add the <application>Panel Trash</application> applet to a panel, perform"
" the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Per apondre l’ajuston <application>Escobilhièr</application> a un panèl, "
"seguissètz las etapas seguentas :"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:145
msgid "Right-click on the panel at the place you want to add the applet."
msgstr ""
"Clicatz amb lo boton drech sul panèl sul luòc ont volètz apondre l'ajuston."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:150
msgid "Choose <guimenuitem>Add to Panel</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "Causir <guimenuitem>Apondre al panèl</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:155
msgid ""
"Scroll down the list of items in the <guilabel>Add to Panel</guilabel> "
"dialog, then select <guilabel>Trash</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Fasètz defilar la lista dels elements de la bóstia de dialòg <guilabel>"
"Apondre al panèl</guilabel>, puèi seleccionatz <guilabel>Escobilhièr</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:160
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>."
msgstr "Clicar <guibutton>Apondre</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:165
msgid ""
"For more information on working with the panel, see the <ulink type=\"help\""
" url=\"help:mate-user-guide/panels\">Desktop User Guide</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Per mai d’informacions sul foncionament del tablèu de bòrd, consultatz la "
"<ulink type=\"help\" url=\"help:mate-user-guide/panels\">Guida d’utilizacion "
"del burèu</ulink>."

